      "bbox": { "x": 50.0, "y": 120.0, "width": 220.0, "height": 130.0 },
      "reading_order": 1,
      "text": "3-Column Section A: The DocVQA task emphasizes spatial scene reasoning, wherein questions necessitate grounding answers across multiple structural table cells and headings.",
