      "bbox": { "x": 290.0, "y": 120.0, "width": 220.0, "height": 130.0 },
      "reading_order": 2,
      "text": "3-Column Section B: Documents exhibit diverse typographical hierarchies, requiring reading order recovery to decouple body paragraphs from floating figures and data matrices.",
      "is_critical": false,
      "metadata": { "subgroup": "rare_case", "column": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": "elem-804",
      "type": "text",
      "bbox": { "x": 530.0, "y": 120.0, "width": 220.0, "height": 130.0 },
      "reading_order": 3,
      "text": "3-Column Section C: Robust confidence calibration is essential to route ambiguous visual questions to human-in-the-loop review queues instead of generating hallucinated answers.",
